1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:01,570
La pluie est douce.

2
00:00:01,570 --> 00:00:02,550
Les rivières aussi.

3
00:00:02,550 --> 00:00:02,830
Pourtant,

4
00:00:02,830 --> 00:00:03,590
elles finissent dans une

5
00:00:03,590 --> 00:00:04,530
mer salée.

6
00:00:04,530 --> 00:00:05,910
Comment c'est possible ?

7
00:00:05,910 --> 00:00:06,730
En mille sept cent

8
00:00:06,730 --> 00:00:06,970
quinze,

9
00:00:06,970 --> 00:00:08,030
Edmond Halley,

10
00:00:08,030 --> 00:00:08,930
celui de la comète,

11
00:00:08,930 --> 00:00:09,890
remarque que les lacs

12
00:00:09,890 --> 00:00:11,410
sans sortie sont salés.

13
00:00:11,410 --> 00:00:12,350
Les rivières apportent un

14
00:00:12,350 --> 00:00:13,150
peu de sel.

15
00:00:13,150 --> 00:00:13,770
Dans un lac sans

16
00:00:13,770 --> 00:00:14,750
sortie,

17
00:00:14,750 --> 00:00:15,670
l'eau ne part qu'en

18
00:00:15,670 --> 00:00:16,610
s'évaporant :

19
00:00:16,610 --> 00:00:17,830
elle monte en vapeur.

20
00:00:17,830 --> 00:00:18,270
Le sel,

21
00:00:18,270 --> 00:00:19,290
lui, reste.

22
00:00:19,290 --> 00:00:20,010
La mer,

23
00:00:20,010 --> 00:00:20,990
c'est un immense lac

24
00:00:20,990 --> 00:00:22,190
sans sortie.

25
00:00:22,190 --> 00:00:22,910
D'où vient ce sel

26
00:00:22,910 --> 00:00:23,370
?

27
00:00:23,370 --> 00:00:24,550
De la roche.

28
00:00:24,550 --> 00:00:25,290
La pluie contient du

29
00:00:25,290 --> 00:00:26,150
gaz carbonique :

30
00:00:26,150 --> 00:00:27,870
un peu acide,

31
00:00:27,870 --> 00:00:28,630
elle ronge la roche

32
00:00:28,630 --> 00:00:29,610
et la dissout,

33
00:00:29,610 --> 00:00:30,610
comme du sucre dans

34
00:00:30,610 --> 00:00:31,810
un café.

35
00:00:31,810 --> 00:00:32,870
Ces minéraux dissous,

36
00:00:32,870 --> 00:00:34,530
ce sont des sels.

37
00:00:34,530 --> 00:00:35,550
Autre source :

38
00:00:35,550 --> 00:00:36,590
des cheminées au fond

39
00:00:36,590 --> 00:00:37,490
de l'océan,

40
00:00:37,490 --> 00:00:38,390
chauffées par la roche

41
00:00:38,390 --> 00:00:39,510
en fusion.

42
00:00:39,510 --> 00:00:40,730
Imagine tout ce sel,

43
00:00:40,730 --> 00:00:41,790
étalé sur toutes les

44
00:00:41,790 --> 00:00:42,870
terres du monde.

45
00:00:42,870 --> 00:00:43,923
Une couche d'environ cent

46
00:00:43,923 --> 00:00:45,410
cinquante mètres.

47
00:00:45,410 --> 00:00:46,310
Un immeuble de quarante

48
00:00:46,310 --> 00:00:47,050
étages.

49
00:00:47,050 --> 00:00:48,330
Partout.

50
00:00:48,490 --> 00:00:49,310
La prochaine fois que

51
00:00:49,310 --> 00:00:50,250
tu bois la tasse,

52
00:00:50,250 --> 00:00:50,910
dis-toi que tu goûtes

53
00:00:50,910 --> 00:00:51,770
de la roche.

54
00:00:51,770 --> 00:00:53,210
Rongée par la pluie,

55
00:00:53,210 --> 00:00:54,350
grain après grain,

56
00:00:54,350 --> 00:00:55,490
depuis des millions d'années.

57
00:00:55,490 --> 00:00:57,070
Et ça continue.

